{
  "title": { "en": "A rule with a condition" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "Both rows of max in <level-ref to=\"def-max\"></level-ref> carry a condition. Once a rule with a condition rewrites a place, the condition becomes a new goal, queued behind; only when it is proved does the rewrite stand."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "en": "Isabelle’s simplifier calls such rules conditional rewrite rules."
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "sp-cond",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "en": "Goal" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "words": ["everyday", "terms"],
      "defs": ["le", "max"],
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "max(s(zero), s(s(zero))) = s(s(zero))" },
        { "goal": "max(s(s(zero)), s(zero)) = s(s(zero))" },
        { "goal": "max(zero, s(zero)) = s(zero)" }
      ],
      "brief": { "en": "Design a proof assistant that proves every goal." },
      "hint": [
        { "en": "Which rule for max applies is not known in advance: try both." },
        { "en": "The way whose condition cannot be proved fails by itself." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0 = append(in, first: c4, second: c8) {",
        "  first {",
        "    c1r0 = math[use=[\"def.3\"]]()",
        "    c2r0 = refl()",
        "    c3r0 = math[use=[\"def.0\", \"def.1\", \"def.2\"]]()",
        "    c4r0 = refl()",
        "    c1 = rw(c0.first, c1r0)",
        "    c2 = rule(c1, c2r0)",
        "    c3 = simp(c2, c3r0)",
        "    c4 = rule(c3, c4r0)",
        "  }",
        "  second {",
        "    c5r0 = math[use=[\"def.4\"]]()",
        "    c6r0 = refl()",
        "    c7r0 = math[use=[\"def.0\", \"def.1\", \"def.2\"]]()",
        "    c8r0 = refl()",
        "    c5 = rw(c0.second, c5r0)",
        "    c6 = rule(c5, c6r0)",
        "    c7 = simp(c6, c7r0)",
        "    c8 = rule(c7, c8r0)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- c0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
